      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "改めて、JAPAN IDOL FES、お疲れさま！\n……って、何回目だろうなぁ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "信玄 誠司"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_01_g:step-5:text",
        "step_id": 5,
        "step_index": 4,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_01_g",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_01_g.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 21,
          "target_step_index": 4
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "自分の狭い家で悪いが、今回の健闘を十分に\n称えあうためにも、引き続き三次会を楽しもう！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "信玄 誠司"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_01_g:step-6:text",
        "step_id": 6,
        "step_index": 5,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_01_g",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_01_g.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 21,
          "target_step_index": 5
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "乾杯！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "全員"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_01_g:step-9:text",
        "step_id": 9,
        "step_index": 8,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_01_g",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_01_g.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 21,
          "target_step_index": 8
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "……くぅ～、うまい！　明日はオフって思うと\n更にうまい！　ほら、くずのはも飲んだ飲んだ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "山下 次郎"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_01_g:step-13:text",
        "step_id": 13,
        "step_index": 12,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_01_g",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_01_g.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 21,
          "target_step_index": 12
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "悪いな、山下サン。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "葛之葉 雨彦"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_01_g:step-15:text",
        "step_id": 15,
        "step_index": 14,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_01_g",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_01_g.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 21,
          "target_step_index": 14
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "はぁ……。俺たちが新人アイドルの登竜門、JIFに\n出て、あんなにステージを盛り上げられるなんて……",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "渡辺 みのり"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_01_g:step-18:text",
        "step_id": 18,
        "step_index": 17,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_01_g",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_01_g.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 21,
          "target_step_index": 17
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "あの盛り上がりは、正直、私の予想をも遥かに\n上回っていた。渡辺君が言葉を失うのも当然だ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "硲 道夫"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_01_g:step-19:text",
        "step_id": 19,
        "step_index": 18,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_01_g",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_01_g.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 21,
          "target_step_index": 18
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "皆さんがJIFに向けて、\n一心に努力し続けたからですよ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_01_g:step-20:text",
        "step_id": 20,
        "step_index": 19,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_01_g",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_01_g.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 21,
          "target_step_index": 19
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "そっか、そうだよね……嬉しいなぁ。\nこの調子で、次に繋げていきたいよね！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "渡辺 みのり"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_01_g:step-21:text",
        "step_id": 21,
        "step_index": 20,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_01_g",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_01_g.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 21,
          "target_step_index": 20
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "うむ。次の目標となると、\n『男極ッ！アイドルリーグ』だろう。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
